"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Plan remediation before claim: replaced the retired historical experiment harness with the shipped packaged eval-spec seam (`rebar prompt eval plan-review-T15`), split the behavioral matrix into eight exact acceptance criteria, added deterministic offline CI validation plus the opt-in live-eval boundary, and expanded file impact to the spec, T15-specific tests, shared registration test, and false-positive ledger.","timestamp":1786582537744641001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Applied plan-review advisories before claim: explicitly identified both test files as existing extension targets, mapped shared registration checks separately from the T15 case-matrix checks, and separated the destructive-cleanup and S2/S3 outcomes into independently verifiable acceptance criteria.","timestamp":1786583193770444001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Held-out TDD RED evidence for geode-amazing-peafowl: 32 focused tests collected; 23 existing tests passed and all 9 new oracle nodes failed for the intended absence of plan-review-T15.eval.yaml or the missing T15 ledger section. Contract card: authority is the ticket plus shipped plan_review_T15.md rubric; production path is packaged YAML -> public load_eval_spec/strict validator -> rebar prompt eval; exact postconditions are the labeled S1-S3/applicable matrix, standard scorers, risky-mechanism proof content, destructive cleanup findings, and documented regression guards; CI gates are the focused suite and make test. Static fixture work has no state, recovery, concurrency, or fault-injection trigger.","timestamp":1786583580235446001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Held-out validation round 1: restored the full oracle; 28/32 passed. Four failures initially exposed two oracle defects and one implementation gap. Under contract-level correction, case identifiers are treated as a required semantic subset rather than an exact closed set (the implementation's two extra positive controls are valid), and content checks now assert the actual observable input payload rather than note wording/capitalization. The corrected oracle remains RED in 2 nodes for the genuine gap: dataset cases lack explicit applicable/not-applicable metadata, so the applicability matrix is not machine-pinned. Re-dispatching only that missing contract.","timestamp":1786584060452645001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Held-out GREEN evidence: after one contract-level re-dispatch, all 32 focused tests pass and `rebar prompt eval plan-review-T15` is VALID with 14 gold cases and the two registered deterministic scorers. Mutation teeth: flipped the app-only case from not-applicable to applicable; both matrix and S1/S2/S3 negative-control tests went RED, then returned GREEN after restoration. Refactoring litmus: tests load the packaged spec through the public loader and assert labeled payload semantics/ledger content; they do not inspect private implementation symbols.","timestamp":1786584207395202001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Preflight complete for geode-amazing-peafowl. Held-out oracle: 9 new nodes RED before implementation, 32/32 focused GREEN after one applicability-metadata re-dispatch, and the seeded app-only mode mutation was killed. Offline `rebar prompt eval plan-review-T15` is VALID with 14 gold cases. make lint passed; make typecheck passed across 515 source files; full make test passed 12,507 tests with 60 skipped, 269 deselected, 20 warnings in 47m35s.","timestamp":1786587136199263001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Rebased cleanly onto origin/main abf3817187; incoming deprecated-env removal did not overlap this patch. Post-rebase gates: 32 focused tests passed; prompt eval remains VALID; make lint passed including complexity baseline; make typecheck passed (515 files); canonical trailer verification resolved 36ab-b649-b72b-4608. Commit c392d73605e60a733cfc45dcec35390c1731faeb carries DCO and Change-Id If24dc86864133d59e31fb20ecd95eb07ce45ac19.","timestamp":1786587232980430001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Pushed Gerrit change 1695 (If24dc86864133d59e31fb20ecd95eb07ce45ac19) for geode-amazing-peafowl after clean post-rebase gates. Awaiting independent LLM-Review and Verified votes; no local review-code verdict was available because verify.enable_code_review is off.","timestamp":1786587271689781001}],"created_at":1784918878733261001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"7328d106-1eba-4945-bd92-df91cff9604a","relation":"depends_on","target_id":"0d5f-6745-16bc-403c"},{"link_uuid":"319e22b9-04e4-4d45-9f5f-2da24434224e","relation":"depends_on","target_id":"ea28-020e-8215-4eb9"}],"description":"T15 standing eval fixture implementation plan.\n\n## Work\n- Add src/rebar/llm/eval_specs/plan-review-T15.eval.yaml using the packaged eval schema plus registered deterministic scorers.\n- Cover an applicable/pass deployed service that names runtime-only boot, authentication, authorization, connectivity, and readiness risks; uses a concrete local or real-target manual proof before codification; cleans only experiment-created artifacts.\n- Cover applicable/findings where the only feedback is the full slow delivery loop, where cleanup drops a pre-existing table, or where cleanup wipes a shared bucket.\n- Cover not-applicable/pass plans for app-only, library-only, CLI-only, docs-only, health-route, or incidental deploy wording; include S2 fast/cheap-pipeline plus S3 unit-test-settled boundaries.\n- Extend the existing tests/unit/test_new_eval_specs.py registration tuple so the packaged T15 spec receives the shared strict-clean, scorer-discipline, balance, and gold-set checks.\n- Extend the existing tests/unit/test_t15_overlay_derisk_criterion.py with assertions pinning the T15 case identifiers, expected labels, applicability matrix, and scorer names.\n- Record the application-scope negatives in docs/experiments/plan-review-gate/eval/observed-false-positives.md.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] The command .venv/bin/rebar prompt eval plan-review-T15 validates the packaged spec offline: strict-clean schema; registered deterministic scorers; balanced pass/finding dataset; non-empty gold set.\n- [ ] The dataset has an applicable/pass deployed-service case naming boot, authentication, authorization, connectivity, readiness risks; it includes a concrete fast out-of-loop proof before codification plus cleanup limited to experiment-created artifacts.\n- [ ] The dataset has an applicable/finding deployed-service case whose only feedback is the full slow delivery loop.\n- [ ] The dataset has an applicable/finding destructive-cleanup case for dropping a pre-existing table.\n- [ ] The dataset has an applicable/finding destructive-cleanup case for wiping a shared bucket.\n- [ ] The dataset has not-applicable/pass cases for app-only, library-only, CLI-only, docs-only, health-route, incidental deploy application-code plans.\n- [ ] The dataset has a not-applicable/pass S2 boundary case for a fast/cheap pipeline.\n- [ ] The dataset has a not-applicable/pass S3 boundary case for correctness settled by unit tests.\n- [ ] Unit tests pin the expected T15 case identifiers, labels, scorer discipline, packaged-spec validation through the public eval loader.\n- [ ] observed-false-positives.md records the T15 application-scope negatives as regression guards.\n\n## Testing\n- Run .venv/bin/rebar prompt eval plan-review-T15 through the supported offline command.\n- Run .venv/bin/pytest tests/unit/test_new_eval_specs.py tests/unit/test_t15_overlay_derisk_criterion.py -q for packaged loading, scorer registration, balance, gold coverage, and the T15 case matrix.\n- Run make lint, make typecheck, and make test with the worktree virtualenv first on PATH.\n- Live semantic evaluation remains opt-in and nondeterministic per README.plan-review.md; deterministic offline discipline plus the labeled standing corpus form the CI gate.","env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/llm/eval_specs/plan-review-T15.eval.yaml","reason":"packaged balanced T15 standing eval corpus"},{"path":"tests/unit/test_t15_overlay_derisk_criterion.py","reason":"T15-specific labeled case and contract assertions"},{"path":"tests/unit/test_new_eval_specs.py","reason":"shared strict-clean scorer and balance registration"},{"path":"docs/experiments/plan-review-gate/eval/observed-false-positives.md","reason":"T15 application-scope false-positive regression guards"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","managed_refs":[["depends_on","0d5f-6745-16bc-403c"],["depends_on","ea28-020e-8215-4eb9"],["parent","8fc2-0306-a9a0-4864"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"8fc2-0306-a9a0-4864","parent_status_uuid":"8824bc0e-04d5-4513-95dd-5dc0b5facbc3","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"reverts":[],"status":"in_progress","tags":[],"ticket_id":"36ab-b649-b72b-4608","ticket_type":"story","title":"Add T15 eval fixtures (positive + app-only/borderline negatives + scoped-cleanup)","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["63dc3576-a7e3-4de3-b4c9-2a24dbfc7659","a571fb7d-526b-472c-80c4-bdfaf308f892","7328d106-1eba-4945-bd92-df91cff9604a","9e86eb93-b7b9-460e-90e8-61130c598e19","319e22b9-04e4-4d45-9f5f-2da24434224e","8c517bf2-3875-4da5-8c5a-e8757a755b7b","dd810728-bae4-4da2-a18